Measurement source attribution
------------------------------
The source index configs/measurement_sources.json identifies measurement runs
in the NUWiNS release associated with:

Exploring the 5G Digital Divide in the Non-Contiguous US:
LEO Satellites to the Rescue? (SIGMETRICS 2026)
DOI: 10.1145/3771568

Authors: Sizhe Wang, Moinak Ghoshal, Yufei Feng, Imran Khan, Phuc Dinh,
Omar Basit, Zhekun Yu, Y. Charlie Hu, and Dimitrios Koutsonikolas.

Source:
https://github.com/NUWiNS/sigmetrics26-exploring-the-5g-digital-divide-in-the-non-contiguous-us-leo-satellites-to-the-rescue

Dataset license: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The source index selects run identifiers and segments from that release.
Measurement processing groups aligned samples into nominal one-second slots
and combines selected capacity sequences with generated service workloads.
